        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-202, Fancy Leaf Cabinet Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA great finishing touch to any piece, the Fancy Leaf furniture pull will bring a beautiful touch of nature inside. It has a sense of movement from the artistic design that elevates it above the ordinary. The Leaf Cabinet Knob is available in 6 finishes including polished brass (pictured) and satin nickel; and it comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/two-leaves-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-402\"><b>CP-402 Leaf Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-202 Leaf Shaped Cabinet Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li?\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
